     +
equals()


hashCode()
→ Helps locate the bucket.


equals()
→ Helps identify the exact key inside that bucket.


======================================================================
HASHMAP PUT() WORKING
----------------------------------------------------------------------

map.put(key, value)

        |
        ↓
Calculate hash
        |
        ↓
Find bucket
        |
        ↓
Is bucket empty?
    /          \
  YES           NO
   |             |
Store entry    Collision
                 |
