HASHMAP TIME COMPLEXITY
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Average:

get() → O(1)
put() → O(1)
remove() → O(1)


Collision chain can result in:

O(n)


With treeified bucket:

O(log n)


IMPORTANT:

These are general complexity characteristics; actual performance
depends on hashing quality, collisions, resizing, and implementation
details.


